                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Baker.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-31"><hi rendition="#italic">March 31,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Time Department had full report of situation Bluefields. Braida instructed he had
                    no diplomatic functions.</p>
